1
00:00:00,654 --> 00:00:02,284
(Bernadette:)Get that guy! Get that guy!

2
00:00:02,448 --> 00:00:04,828
Pew, pew, pew!

3
00:00:06,035 --> 00:00:08,575
Uh, Dr. Rostenkowski,
it may interest you to know...

4
00:00:08,746 --> 00:00:13,456
...that saying, "Pew, pew, pew," isn't
as effective as pressing your blaster key.

5
00:00:13,959 --> 00:00:18,419
ln the same way that saying, "Whee,"
doesn't make the landspeeder go.

6
00:00:19,882 --> 00:00:21,712
(Bernadette:)Pew!

7
00:00:22,968 --> 00:00:26,638
- Raj, lmperial Troopers on your tail.
Unh. Got him.

8
00:00:26,972 --> 00:00:29,762
(Raj:)When Gandhi advocated
his philosophy of nonviolence...

9
00:00:29,934 --> 00:00:33,644
...l bet he didn't know how much fun
it was killing stuff.

10
00:00:34,480 --> 00:00:37,860
(Leonard:)All right, I think we got them all.
Let's divide up the loot.

11
00:00:38,025 --> 00:00:40,365
(Bernadette:)Ooh, look at
this pretty purple robe I just got.

12
00:00:40,528 --> 00:00:42,818
(Bernadette:)You should put on yours
and then we'll match.

13
00:00:42,988 --> 00:00:45,658
But I worked hard to get this armor, heh.

14
00:00:45,825 --> 00:00:49,785
(Bernadette:)Sorry, I just thought it'd be nice
if people knew we were a couple.

15
00:00:50,830 --> 00:01:05,020
(Howard:)Fine, I'll change.

